  npcName: Nefru
  npcSprite: {fileID: -5515134220035640716, guid: ddbceaba23c740362980f9a3adb780a2, type: 3}
  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - My name was Nefru.
    - I came from Thebes.
  - snippets:
    - I worked building temples from a young age.
    - I could carry stones that many people could not lift alone.
  - snippets:
    - Once, I worked for three days with almost no rest.
    - I was never very good at talking to people.
  - snippets:
    - I preferred to be given a task and simply complete it.
    - When there was a problem, I tried to solve it with my own hands.
